(7488136, 1191767, 105457, '<td valign="top">Peculiar editing, I think I''ve never seen anything similar. The tones are beautiful, the woman''s pose seems a bit stiff and posed.</td>', 'Peculiar editing, I think I''ve never seen anything similar. The tones are beautiful, the woman''s pose seems a bit stiff and posed.', '2016-12-21 09:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
